  "name": "Table 75: Soul Crystal Explosives",
  "img": "icons/svg/d20-grey.svg",
  "description": "<p><em>Rulebook Table 75 (p.322).</em> Physically touching a Soul Crystal can cause it to explode, dealing damage based on the crystal's grade to everything in a 50-foot radius (further 50-foot blast radius beyond that; halve both radii for crystals at half power or less). This table is keyed by crystal grade rather than randomly rolled in play; ranges below (A=1 .. E=5) are assigned for compendium/roll-tooling consistency.</p>",
